{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"夏寶龍到中大深圳分校調研 \" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-20-20-01-19HI4fDIFb.jpg\"><p></p><p>【Now新聞台】港澳辦主任夏寶龍於香港中文大學深圳分校調研。</p><p>夏寶龍聽取中大深圳分校校長徐揚生介紹，並肯定學校的辦學方向，希望學校繼續發揮獨特優勢，更好服務粵港澳大灣區建設。</p><p>港澳辦分管日常工作的副主任徐啟方、副主任農融、教育局局長蔡若蓮亦有隨行。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T12:23:59.417764+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:31:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T00:17:32.638399+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T12:17:30.798010+00:00","content_hash":"d701d88e760a63e637a7aa513d59f363c7dac64921a4c93e439728d9e7cc1939","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}